# A two-bar chip groove over three drum tracks: kicks, snares and a coin, hats with an open hat choked.
tempo 120
steps 32
tail 1.0
track kick
param p1 128 0
param p2 128 0
note 0 F3 1
note 6 F3 1 90
note 8 Ab3 1
note 16 F3 1
note 22 Gb3 1 100
note 24 F3 1
track snare
param p1 128 0
param p2 128 0
note 4 A3 1
note 12 Bb3 1
note 20 A3 1
note 28 B3 1
note 30 B4 1 90
track perc
param p1 128 0
param p2 160 0
note 0 Db4 1 90
note 2 Db4 1 60
note 4 Db4 1 90
note 6 Eb4 2 80
note 8 Db4 1 90
note 10 Db4 1 60
note 12 D4 1 90
note 14 Eb4 2 80
note 16 Db4 1 90
note 18 Db4 1 60
note 20 Db4 1 90
note 22 E4 2 80
note 24 Db4 1 90
note 26 D4 1 80
note 28 Db4 1 90
note 30 Eb4 2 80
expect sound 0 32
expect idle 40
expect peak_below 0
